# Risk Scoring & Threat Prioritisation
# -----------------------------------
# Purpose:
# Combine multiple weak security signals into a
# single risk score to drive escalation and response.

# Initialise risk score
risk_score = 0

# Aggregate detection signals
risk_score += anomaly_weight * anomaly_score
risk_score += identity_weight * identity_risk
risk_score += asset_weight * asset_criticality

# Decision threshold
IF risk_score >= escalation_threshold:
    Mark threat as high confidence
    forward to response orchestration
